# Reset the reveal so the scene plays correctly on a replay or a reloaded save.
set {elion_name} = "Elion"
set {theo_name} = "???"

narrator: Remi finished his dance with a proud bow as Elion applauded enthusiastically.

join elion (Smile) right
elion (Smile): Fantastic! Just as I expected from such a talented dancer!
join remi (Happy) left
remi (Happy): Squeak!
elion (Smile): Your moves were wonderful, Sir Remi. I can see how much effort you have put into them.
elion (Default): You truly have worked hard for this dream.
elion (Smile): Then it is settled. As promised, I shall accompany you as your teammate.
elion (Determined): Together, we shall enter this contest and claim that grand prize!
elion (Confused): Although... that reminds me. You said we require a group of four, correct?
remi (Sad): Squeak…
elion (Thinking): Hmm... Then we still need two more companions.
elion (Default): I wonder who might be willing to join us-

narrator: Before Elion could finish his sentence, someone suddenly crashed straight into him.

elion (Surprised): Whoa-!

narrator: It was a young elf boy who seemed to have been in a rush to go somewhere.

join theo (Surprised) leftmost

theo: Ah-!

narrator: A young boy with green hair and a charming face stumbled into view. From the wand in his hand, he appeared to be some kind of spellcaster.
narrator: He fell to the ground, his green hair dropping over his face as the wand slipped from his hand.
narrator: Looking dazed and confused, he slowly raised his head toward Elion, who was already kneeling beside him to help.

elion (Surprised): I am terribly sorry! Are you alright-
elion (Confused): Oh! It is you!
theo: Eh...? Isn't it Elion? What are the odds of running into you here…!

narrator: It seemed that Elion and the mysterious boy already knew each other somehow.
narrator: Elion helped him back onto his feet before picking up the fallen wand and handing it back to him.

elion (Default): Well, I am currently looking for members to join a dancing contest at the festival.
elion (Smile): We need a group of four, so I am helping gather enough people to enter.
theo (Surprised): Ah! The dance contest!
theo (Smile): I'm actually going to sign up for it! They promise quite a lot of gold as a reward. I really need those for my research fund…!
theo (Default): Sorry, Elion…! I have to part with you now. Hope we meet again…!

update remi (Surprised)
update elion (Surprised)

narrator: As the boy was about to sprint off, Elion and Remi stopped him from rushing forward!

elion (Determined): Sir Theo! We are also going to participate in the contest too! Could you hear us out for a while? We need two more members for our party right now…!

# Elion says his name here, so the name box stops saying ??? from this point on.
set {theo_name} = "Theo"

remi (Please): Squeak! Squeak squeak!! Squeak—!
theo (Surprised): !!!
theo (Confused): …
elion: …!!!
remi: …!!!
theo (Thinking): …
theo (Default): …Alright. I could team up with you. However, you said you needed two more members. So it's Elion and…?
elion (Default): Pardon me, Sir Theo. This is my companion and reliable teammate, Sir Remi!
remi (Happy): Squeak!
elion (Smile): And Sir Remi, this is Sir [b]Theo[/b], a wonderful [b]mage[/b] companion of mine.
theo (Smile): Nice to meet you, Mr. Remi.
elion (Determined): Sir Theo, Sir Remi here is an exquisite and determined dancer. He is a pure soul who follows his dream despite the segregation and discrimination of his kind in the performing industry. I guarantee Sir Remi is a promising member of our team.
remi (Please): Squeak…
theo (Surprised): …!
theo (Thinking): …
theo: (Elion is talking with a rat…? Since when could he do that…?)
theo (Confused): (Ah… The rat… Remi was it…? Mister Remi is also a dancer…? And he was discriminated against in the industry because he is a rat? Wait— A rat can dance?! I have never seen one dance before. They can dance???)
theo (Thinking): (No, no, no. That is a prejudice that rats can't dance, is it? Isn't that the same thing as what Mr. Remi faced? I'm… a bad person?)
theo (Crashout): (From the first place, performing industry…? Rat language? Dancing rats? What is this information?! Why is Elion so normal about this??? Is this normal??? I guess this is normal???)
elion (Confused): Theo, sir?
remi (Confused): Squeak…?
theo (Surprised): Ah— Um…! Sorry…!
theo (Thinking): I get the situation now. If that's the case, I can join your party!...
theo (Default): However, I really aim to win this competition. I need to see your capability first. Excuse my formalistic procedure, but would you mind showing your skills to me?
remi (Surprised): !!!
elion (Determined): This is an amazing opportunity, Sir Remi! Let's show him what you are made of.
theo (Smile): I do know Elion and his style, so I must admit I am a little bit curious about you, new fella. I would appreciate it if you would be so kind as to dance to my tune?
remi (Happy): Squeak! Squeak squeak!
elion (Smile): Now that's the spirit! Let's dance right away!
theo: Thank you, Mr. Remi.
theo: (I'm glad my confusion didn't offend him.)
theo (Thinking): (And also, thank the universe I didn't ask Elion if Mr. Remi was his midday snack at first when I saw him holding a rat.)
theo (Crashout): (That would be so much more awkward...)